plot3d(rsiSlow, "RSI Trend", "ribbon", "#22ccff", "separate", 1)`},{name:"Volume 3D Bars",description:"Volume histogram as 3D bars — makes volume spikes pop out of the chart",category:"3D Visualizations",source:`// Volume 3D Bars — columns + relative-volume ridge + climax spikes
