plot3d(d, "Stoch Signal", "ribbon", "#ff8800", "separate", 1)`},{name:"ADX Vortex Funnel",description:'Trend strength (ADX) as a six-armed converging spiral tornado ("vortex" style)',category:"3D Visualizations",source:`// ADX Vortex Funnel — spiral + strength ribbon + trend-birth cones
